          "settings": {
            "html": "<div class='lp-window-inner'><div class='lp-window-eyebrow'>The window</div><p class='lp-window-quote'>\"They're <em>seven</em> once.<br>This is the season.\"</p><div class='lp-window-rule'></div><p class='lp-window-sub'>Research on attachment, emotional development, and self-concept formation is clear — the years between 5 and 11 are when a child's inner world is most actively shaped by the people around them. After that the window doesn't close, but it narrows. The child in front of you right now is in it.</p></div><style>*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box}.lp-window-inner{max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;position:relative;z-index:1}.lp-window-eyebrow{font-family:'Lato',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#688F9D;margin-bottom:2rem;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:0.8rem}.lp-window-eyebrow::before,.lp-window-eyebrow::after{content:'';width:2rem;height:1px;background:#688F9D;display:block}.lp-window-quote{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif !important;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3.5vw,3rem);font-weight:300;font-style:italic;color:#F7F0EC;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.lp-window-quote em{color:#D9E8EB}.lp-window-rule{width:40px;height:1px;background:rgba(104,143,157,0.4);margin:0 auto 2.5rem}.lp-window-sub{font-family:'Lato',sans-serif !important;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.9;color:rgba(217,232,235,0.55);max-width:520px;margin:0 auto}</style>"
